<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, why was He there as the Bearer of sin,</l><l>If on Jesus thy guilt was not laid?</l><l>Oh, why from His side flowed the sin-cleansing blood,</l><l>If His dying thy debt has not paid?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>It is not thy tears of repentance or prayers,</l><l>But the blood, that redeemeth the soul;</l><l>On Him, then, who shed it, thou mayest at once</l><l>Thy weight of iniquities roll.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Then doubt not thy welcome, since God has declared</l><l>There remaineth no more to be done;</l><l>That once in the end of the world He appeared,</l><l>And completed the work He begun.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Then take with rejoicing from Jesus at once</l><l>The life everlasting He gives;</l><l>And know with assurance, thou never canst die</l><l>Since Jesus, thy Righteousness, lives.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
